      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call them but they're closed right now and i can't wait until tomorrow if my sugar stays this high... it's already at 220. if i just do the 25 units like i thought, that's 1 unit for every 4.8g or something like that, which sounds pretty close to my 1:5 ratio. isn't it better to just take a little extra now to get it down than to risk staying high all night? like, just tell me if 25 units sounds like a safe amount to take for 120g of carbs.",
